OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and showers, the
OL,6,Fshowers heaviest and most frequent in
OL,7,Fthe west during the afternoon. Best of
OL,8,Fany sunshine around Inverness and the
OL,9,Fmore sheltered east. Breezy, strong
OL,10,Fwinds developing around the west coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHeavy and frequent squally
OL,13,Fshowers during this evening and
OL,14,Fovernight, the risk of the odd rumble
OL,15,Fof thunder. Occasional drier spells in
OL,16,Fthe east. Windy with coastal gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
