OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRemaining windy and showery,
OL,6,Fthe showers heavy with the risk of the
OL,7,Fodd thunderstorm. A few drier and
OL,8,Fbright spells in the east. Coastal
OL,9,Fgales.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,12,Fwith occasional showers and easing
OL,13,Fwinds on Saturday. Windy with heavy
OL,14,Frain on Sunday. Brighter with showers
OL,15,Fand easing winds on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
